  (text "HARNESS CONNECTOR (24 pin) - placeholder.\nEach pin ends in a no-connect flag. Place your connector, delete the X, wire its pin to the stub.\nGND pins 2 + 24 carry all output current. GND_SENS = quiet sensor ground (star-tied on main sheet, NT1)."
